     "CLOCK PROB DRUM DRUM#2 MIX OUT|CLOCK.CLK>PROB.TRIG PROB.A>DRUM.TRIG PROB.B>DRUM#2.TRIG DRUM.OUT>MIX.IN_1 DRUM#2.OUT>MIX.IN_2 MIX.L>OUT.L|@PLAY PROB.CHANCE=0.5 DRUM.PRESET=1 DRUM#2.PRESET=20"},
    {PW_T_CHORD, "One pitch in, a chord of four out: each drives its own oscillator. TYPE picks the chord, INVERT and SPREAD move it.",
     "KEYS CHORD VCO VCO#2 VCO#3 VCO#4 MIX ENV VCA OUT|KEYS.PITCH>CHORD.V/OCT CHORD.N1>VCO.V/OCT CHORD.N2>VCO#2.V/OCT CHORD.N3>VCO#3.V/OCT CHORD.N4>VCO#4.V/OCT VCO.SAW>MIX.IN_1 VCO#2.SAW>MIX.IN_2 VCO#3.SAW>MIX.IN_3 VCO#4.SAW>MIX.IN_4 MIX.L>VCA.IN KEYS.GATE>ENV.GATE ENV.ENV>VCA.CV VCA.OUT>OUT.L|ENV.SUSTAIN=0.9"},
    {PW_T_FORMANT, "A voice-like oscillator: VOWEL picks the vowel, WIDTH how sharp it is. An LFO on VOWEL makes it sing through them.",
     "KEYS FORM LFO ENV VCA OUT|KEYS.PITCH>FORM.V/OCT LFO.TRI>FORM.VOWEL FORM.OUT>VCA.IN KEYS.GATE>ENV.GATE ENV.ENV>VCA.CV VCA.OUT>OUT.L|LFO.RATE=0.3 ENV.SUSTAIN=0.9"},
    {PW_T_COMB, "A comb filter: a noise burst ringing at the key's pitch is a plucked, metallic tone. FBK is how long it rings.",
     "KEYS NOISE ENV VCA COMB OUT|KEYS.PITCH>COMB.V/OCT NOISE.WHITE>VCA.IN KEYS.GATE>ENV.GATE ENV.ENV>VCA.CV VCA.OUT>COMB.IN COMB.OUT>OUT.L|ENV.ATTACK=0.001 ENV.DECAY=0.02 ENV.SUSTAIN=0 ENV.RELEASE=0.02 COMB.FBK=0.9"},
    {PW_T_EQ, "A three-band equalizer: LOW and HIGH shelves and a sweepable MID bell (MID F, Q). Here it brightens a dull saw.",
     "KEYS VCO ENV VCA EQ OUT|KEYS.PITCH>VCO.V/OCT VCO.SAW>VCA.IN KEYS.GATE>ENV.GATE ENV.ENV>VCA.CV VCA.OUT>EQ.IN EQ.OUT>OUT.L|ENV.SUSTAIN=0.9 EQ.HIGH=6 EQ.MID=-4"},
    {PW_T_WAVESET, "A saw cut into cycles; an LFO sweeps AMOUNT so they repeat more and less: a stuttering voice. A gate on FREEZE holds one.",
     "KEYS VCO LFO WVSET ENV VCA OUT|KEYS.PITCH>VCO.V/OCT VCO.SAW>WVSET.IN LFO.TRI>WVSET.AMOUNT WVSET.OUT>VCA.IN KEYS.GATE>ENV.GATE ENV.ENV>VCA.CV VCA.OUT>OUT.L|WVSET.MODE=0 WVSET.GROUP=1 LFO.RATE=0.3 ENV.SUSTAIN=0.8"},
    {PW_T_MUTATE, "A pulse on NUDGE moves the notes and knobs a little, so the tune slowly wanders. Patch ROLL for jumps.",
     "CLOCK EUCL SEQ VCO VCF ENV VCA MUTATE OUT|CLOCK.CLK>SEQ.CLOCK CLOCK.CLK>EUCL.CLOCK EUCL.GATE>MUTATE.NUDGE SEQ.PITCH>VCO.V/OCT SEQ.GATE>ENV.GATE VCO.SAW>VCF.IN VCF.LP>VCA.IN ENV.ENV>VCA.CV VCA.OUT>OUT.L|@PLAY @SEQ=0,3,7,3,10,7,3,0 EUCL.STEPS=16 EUCL.HITS=1 MUTATE.AMOUNT=0.3 MUTATE.DENSITY=0.4 VCF.CUTOFF=900 VCF.RES=0.35 ENV.DECAY=0.2 ENV.SUSTAIN=0.1"},
    {PW_T_PSHIFT, "Moves the sound up or down by SHIFT semitones, keeping its length. Mixed with the original it makes a harmony.",
     "KEYS VCO ENV VCA SHIFT OUT|KEYS.PITCH>VCO.V/OCT VCO.SAW>VCA.IN KEYS.GATE>ENV.GATE ENV.ENV>VCA.CV VCA.OUT>SHIFT.IN SHIFT.OUT>OUT.L|ENV.SUSTAIN=0.9 SHIFT.SHIFT=7 SHIFT.MIX=0.5"},
    {PW_T_TRIGSEQ, "A drum grid: four tracks of 16 steps drawn on its page, with chance, swing, fills. A, B, C play kick, snare, hat.",
     "CLOCK TRIG DRUM DRUM#2 DRUM#3 MIX OUT|CLOCK.CLK>TRIG.CLOCK TRIG.A>DRUM.TRIG TRIG.B>DRUM#2.TRIG TRIG.C>DRUM#3.TRIG DRUM.OUT>MIX.IN_1 DRUM#2.OUT>MIX.IN_2 DRUM#3.OUT>MIX.IN_3 MIX.L>OUT.L|@PLAY @TRIG=A:1000100010001000,B:0000100000001001,C:1010101010101011 DRUM.PRESET=1 DRUM#2.PRESET=10 DRUM#3.PRESET=20"},
    {PW_T_DRUMRACK, "Eight drum pads: T1-T8 strike them, KIT swaps all eight sounds (808, 909...). A drum grid plays the first four.",
     "CLOCK TRIG RACK OUT|CLOCK.CLK>TRIG.CLOCK TRIG.A>RACK.T1 TRIG.B>RACK.T2 TRIG.C>RACK.T3 TRIG.D>RACK.T4 RACK.L>OUT.L RACK.R>OUT.R|@PLAY @TRIG=A:1000100010001000,B:0000100000001001,C:1010101010101011,D:0000000100000100"},
    {PW_T_MIDIIN, "A controller's knobs (CC A-D) as voltages, plus its clock and start/stop. Here CC A (the mod wheel) opens the filter.",
     "KEYS MIDIN VCO VCF ENV VCA OUT|KEYS.PITCH>VCO.V/OCT VCO.SAW>VCF.IN VCF.LP>VCA.IN MIDIN.CC_A>VCF.FREQ KEYS.GATE>ENV.GATE ENV.ENV>VCA.CV VCA.OUT>OUT.L|VCF.CUTOFF=300 ENV.SUSTAIN=0.9"},
    {PW_T_MIDIOUT, "Plays other gear over USB. What you play on KEYS also goes out as MIDI notes (PITCH, GATE, VEL) while the voice plays.",
     "KEYS VCO ENV VCA MIDOUT OUT|KEYS.PITCH>VCO.V/OCT VCO.SAW>VCA.IN KEYS.GATE>ENV.GATE ENV.ENV>VCA.CV VCA.OUT>OUT.L KEYS.PITCH>MIDOUT.PITCH KEYS.GATE>MIDOUT.GATE KEYS.VEL>MIDOUT.VEL|ENV.SUSTAIN=0.9"},
    {PW_T_CVREC, "Records what a knob (or a patched voltage) does over LENGTH beats, then loops it. Here the loop sweeps the bass filter: MOTION BASS.",
     "SEQ CVREC VCO ENV VCF VCA DIST OUT|SEQ.PITCH>VCO.V/OCT SEQ.GATE>ENV.GATE VCO.SAW>VCF.IN CVREC.OUT>VCF.FREQ VCF.LP>VCA.IN ENV.ENV>VCA.CV VCA.OUT>DIST.IN DIST.OUT>OUT.L DIST.OUT>OUT.R|@PLAY @SEQ=0,0,12,0,0,7,0,10,0,0,3,0,5,0,7,12 VCO.TUNE=-24 CVREC.SMOOTH=0.08 VCF.TYPE=1 VCF.CUTOFF=120 VCF.RES=0.78 VCF.CV_AMT=0.7 ENV.DECAY=0.25 ENV.SUSTAIN=0.4 DIST.DRIVE=0.3"},
    {PW_T_GRAIN, "A cloud of tiny grains cut from what comes in. POS is where, SIZE how long, DENSITY how many, SPREAD the scatter.",
     "KEYS VCO ENV VCA GRAIN OUT|KEYS.PITCH>VCO.V/OCT VCO.SAW>VCA.IN KEYS.GATE>ENV.GATE ENV.ENV>VCA.CV VCA.OUT>GRAIN.IN GRAIN.L>OUT.L GRAIN.R>OUT.R|ENV.SUSTAIN=0.9 ENV.RELEASE=0.4"},
    {PW_T_TAPE, "A tape machine: DRIVE saturates, WOW and FLUTTER wobble pitch, AGE dulls, HISS adds noise. A gate on STOP brakes it.",
     "KEYS VCO ENV VCA TAPE OUT|KEYS.PITCH>VCO.V/OCT VCO.SAW>VCA.IN KEYS.GATE>ENV.GATE ENV.ENV>VCA.CV VCA.OUT>TAPE.IN TAPE.OUT>OUT.L|ENV.SUSTAIN=0.9 ENV.RELEASE=0.4"},
    {PW_T_SCOPE, "Draws A and B on its page. Here the saw and the filter it feeds: open the scope to watch what the filter does.",
     "KEYS VCO VCF ENV VCA SCOPE OUT|KEYS.PITCH>VCO.V/OCT VCO.SAW>VCF.IN VCF.LP>VCA.IN VCO.SAW>SCOPE.A VCF.LP>SCOPE.B KEYS.GATE>ENV.GATE ENV.ENV>VCA.CV VCA.OUT>OUT.L|VCF.CUTOFF=500 ENV.SUSTAIN=0.9"},
    {PW_T_GATEDLY, "Each gate comes out later by TIME. A kick's gate triggers a second drum a moment after it, like a flam or echo.",
     "CLOCK EUCL GDLY DRUM DRUM#2 MIX OUT|CLOCK.CLK>EUCL.CLOCK EUCL.GATE>DRUM.TRIG EUCL.GATE>GDLY.A GDLY.A>DRUM#2.TRIG DRUM.OUT>MIX.IN_1 DRUM#2.OUT>MIX.IN_2 MIX.L>OUT.L|@PLAY EUCL.HITS=4 GDLY.TIME_A=0.18 DRUM.PRESET=1 DRUM#2.PRESET=14"},
    {PW_T_ADDITIVE, "32 sine partials shaped by SHAPE, BRIGHT and PEAK; STRETCH makes bells. GATE plucks it. PRESET picks a sound.",
     "KEYS ADDTV OUT|KEYS.PITCH>ADDTV.V/OCT KEYS.GATE>ADDTV.GATE ADDTV.L>OUT.L ADDTV.R>OUT.R|ADDTV.PRESET=1"},
    {PW_T_MACRO, "Eight oscillators in one: MODEL picks the kind, HARM, TIMBRE and MORPH shape it, TRIG strikes its own gate.",
     "KEYS MACRO OUT|KEYS.PITCH>MACRO.V/OCT KEYS.TRIG>MACRO.TRIG MACRO.OUT>OUT.L|MACRO.PRESET=1"},
    {PW_T_MICROPERC, "Clicks, zaps, ticks and crackle. Every hit from the Euclid rhythm is a little different; SCATTER sets how much.",
     "CLOCK EUCL MICRO OUT|CLOCK.CLK>EUCL.CLOCK EUCL.GATE>MICRO.TRIG MICRO.OUT>OUT.L|@PLAY EUCL.HITS=9 MICRO.SCATTER=0.5"},
    {PW_T_ENVFOLLOW, "Each drum hit opens a shut filter on a held saw: a rhythmic wah. GAIN sets how far, RELEASE how fast it closes.",
     "CLOCK EUCL DRUM VCO FOLLOW VCF MIX OUT|CLOCK.CLK>EUCL.CLOCK EUCL.GATE>DRUM.TRIG DRUM.OUT>FOLLOW.IN FOLLOW.ENV>VCF.FREQ VCO.SAW>VCF.IN VCF.LP>MIX.IN_1 DRUM.OUT>MIX.IN_2 MIX.L>OUT.L|@PLAY EUCL.STEPS=16 EUCL.HITS=3 DRUM.PRESET=1 DRUM.DECAY=0.12 FOLLOW.RELEASE=0.12 FOLLOW.GAIN=1.3 VCF.CUTOFF=70 VCF.RES=0.65 VCO.TUNE=-24 MIX.LEVEL_1=0.9 MIX.LEVEL_2=0.45"},
    {PW_T_MODSEQ, "A MOD SEQ lane steps the filter's cutoff in time with the notes. Lanes B to D can drive anything else.",
     "CLOCK SEQ MSEQ VCO VCF ENV VCA OUT|CLOCK.CLK>SEQ.CLOCK CLOCK.CLK>MSEQ.CLOCK SEQ.PITCH>VCO.V/OCT SEQ.GATE>ENV.GATE VCO.SAW>VCF.IN VCF.LP>VCA.IN MSEQ.LANE_A>VCF.FREQ ENV.ENV>VCA.CV VCA.OUT>OUT.L|@PLAY @SEQ=0,3,7,3,10,7,3,0 MSEQ.LEN_A=8 VCF.CUTOFF=300 VCF.RES=0.4 ENV.DECAY=0.2 ENV.SUSTAIN=0.1"},
    {PW_T_CHORDSTEPS, "A progression in a key: each step a degree, a rest or a tie. N1 to N3 play three oscillators. Edit it on SEQ.",
     "CLOCK CSTEP VCO VCO#2 VCO#3 MIX ENV VCA OUT|CLOCK.CLK>CSTEP.CLOCK CSTEP.N1>VCO.V/OCT CSTEP.N2>VCO#2.V/OCT CSTEP.N3>VCO#3.V/OCT VCO.SAW>MIX.IN_1 VCO#2.SAW>MIX.IN_2 VCO#3.SAW>MIX.IN_3 MIX.L>VCA.IN CSTEP.GATE>ENV.GATE ENV.ENV>VCA.CV VCA.OUT>OUT.L|@PLAY ENV.ATTACK=0.04 ENV.SUSTAIN=0.7 ENV.RELEASE=0.3 CSTEP.OCTAVE=0"},
    {PW_T_GRAVITY, "A bouncing ball plays a tune: each bounce is the next note, faster and softer. ELASTIC sets how long it lasts.",
     "GRAV VCO ENV VCA OUT|GRAV.PITCH>VCO.V/OCT VCO.TRI>VCA.IN GRAV.GATE>ENV.GATE ENV.ENV>VCA.CV VCA.OUT>OUT.L|@PLAY ENV.ATTACK=0.001 ENV.DECAY=0.25 ENV.SUSTAIN=0 GRAV.ELASTIC=0.8"},
    {PW_T_LISTENER, "A kick and a hat play a tone. LISTEN hears each hit and picks the note by how bright it is: dull low, sharp high.",
     "CLOCK TRIG DRUM DRUM#2 MIX LISTEN VCO ENV VCA OUT|CLOCK.CLK>TRIG.CLOCK TRIG.A>DRUM.TRIG TRIG.B>DRUM#2.TRIG DRUM.OUT>MIX.IN_1 DRUM#2.OUT>MIX.IN_2 MIX.L>LISTEN.IN LISTEN.PITCH>VCO.V/OCT LISTEN.GATE>ENV.GATE VCO.TRI>VCA.IN ENV.ENV>VCA.CV VCA.OUT>OUT.L|@PLAY @TRIG=A:1000100010001000,B:0010001000101011 DRUM.PRESET=1 DRUM#2.PRESET=20 ENV.DECAY=0.2 ENV.SUSTAIN=0"},
    {PW_T_LIMITER, "A saw pad pumping: PUMP ducks it on every beat and RECOVER swells it back. DRIVE into CEILING makes anything louder.",
     "VCO LIMIT OUT|VCO.SAW>LIMIT.IN LIMIT.OUT>OUT.L|@PLAY VCO.TUNE=-12 LIMIT.DRIVE=0 LIMIT.PUMP=0.85 LIMIT.RECOVER=0.3"},
    {PW_T_OTT, "A short pluck, squeezed from both sides: the tail comes up until it hangs on as loud as the hit. DEPTH is how much.",
     "KEYS VCO ENV VCA OTT OUT|KEYS.PITCH>VCO.V/OCT VCO.SAW>VCA.IN KEYS.GATE>ENV.GATE ENV.ENV>VCA.CV VCA.OUT>OTT.IN OTT.OUT>OUT.L|ENV.DECAY=0.3 ENV.SUSTAIN=0 OTT.DEPTH=1"},
    {PW_T_LOOPER, "A riff plays into the looper (4 beats). REC layers each pass, FBK fades the older ones. Turn REC off to keep the loop.",
     "CLOCK SEQ VCO ENV VCA LOOP OUT|CLOCK.CLK>SEQ.CLOCK SEQ.PITCH>VCO.V/OCT SEQ.GATE>ENV.GATE VCO.SAW>VCA.IN ENV.ENV>VCA.CV VCA.OUT>LOOP.IN LOOP.OUT>OUT.L|@PLAY @SEQ=0,0,7,0,3,0,10,0 ENV.DECAY=0.15 ENV.SUSTAIN=0 LOOP.BEATS=4 LOOP.REC=1 LOOP.FBK=0.7 LOOP.DRY=1"},
    {PW_T_GENDY, "The wave's corners wander every cycle, so each note drifts. A CHAOS moves their heights, T CHAOS their spacing; DIST the odds.",
     "KEYS GENDY ENV VCA OUT|KEYS.PITCH>GENDY.V/OCT GENDY.OUT>VCA.IN KEYS.GATE>ENV.GATE ENV.ENV>VCA.CV VCA.OUT>OUT.L|GENDY.A_CHAOS=0.45 GENDY.T_CHAOS=0.4 GENDY.SMOOTH=0.4 ENV.SUSTAIN=0.7"},
    {PW_T_CZ, "A CZ voice: a resonant wave that closes as the note fades. PRESET 1 is INIT, to build on.",
     "KEYS CZ OUT|KEYS.PITCH>CZ.V/OCT KEYS.GATE>CZ.GATE CZ.OUT>OUT.L CZ.OUT>OUT.R|CZ.WAVE_1=5 CZ.DCW=0.8 CZ.VIB=0.2"},
    {PW_T_FMDX, "A TX81Z FM voice: PRESET 2 is an electric piano. An envelope into INDEX brightens it; PRESET 1 (INIT) is a blank to build on.",
     "KEYS FMDX OUT|KEYS.PITCH>FMDX.V/OCT KEYS.GATE>FMDX.GATE FMDX.OUT>OUT.L FMDX.OUT>OUT.R|FMDX.PRESET=2"},
    {PW_T_ROOM, "A clock clicks noise into the room by itself: its modes ring on, a chord that is not a scale. SHAPE moves the walls.",
     "CLOCK NOISE ENV VCA ROOM OUT|CLOCK.CLK>ENV.GATE NOISE.WHITE>VCA.IN ENV.ENV>VCA.CV VCA.OUT>ROOM.IN ROOM.L>OUT.L ROOM.R>OUT.R|ENV.ATTACK=0.001 ENV.DECAY=0.3 ENV.SUSTAIN=0 ROOM.DECAY=4 ROOM.MIX=1"},
    {PW_T_VOCODER, "A drum beat shapes a saw chord: it thumps with the kick and sizzles with the hat. Turn MIX down to hear the plain chord.",
     "CLOCK TRIG RACK CHORD VCO VCO#2 VCO#3 MIX VOCOD OUT|CLOCK.CLK>TRIG.CLOCK TRIG.A>RACK.T1 TRIG.B>RACK.T2 TRIG.C>RACK.T3 RACK.L>VOCOD.MOD CHORD.N1>VCO.V/OCT CHORD.N2>VCO#2.V/OCT CHORD.N3>VCO#3.V/OCT VCO.SAW>MIX.IN_1 VCO#2.SAW>MIX.IN_2 VCO#3.SAW>MIX.IN_3 MIX.L>VOCOD.CARRIER VOCOD.OUT>OUT.L|@PLAY @TRIG=A:1000100010001000,B:0000100000001000,C:1010101010101011"},
};
